        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brad Budde, Lamar Hunt\n- Organizations: Kansas City Chiefs, Dallas Texans, American Football League, NFL\n- Events: 1980 NFL Draft\n\nFacts:\n- The Kansas City Chiefs franchise was founded in 1960 as the Dallas Texans by businessman Lamar Hunt.\n- The Dallas Texans franchise was a charter member of the American Football League.\n- The Dallas Texans franchise was not associated with an earlier Dallas Texans NFL team that played only one season in 1952.\n- Brad Budde was a first-round pick in the 1980 NFL Draft.\n- Brad Budde played professionally for the NFL's Kansas City Chiefs.",
